WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:11.522
In tutorial 10.1, you'll invite your
colleagues, and give each one the right access.

00:00:12.582 --> 00:00:15.737
First, open Company
settings, and click Team.

00:00:15.787 --> 00:00:18.852
Everyone in your company is
listed here, with their role.

00:00:19.805 --> 00:00:24.684
Below, What each role can do explains the
four roles, from Owner down to Viewer.

00:00:26.351 --> 00:00:30.599
Now click Invite people, and type
your colleague's work e-mail address.

00:00:33.326 --> 00:00:38.851
Then choose a role. Admins manage websites
and the team, members start analyses,

00:00:38.901 --> 00:00:41.546
and viewers only see
dashboards and reports.

00:00:42.551 --> 00:00:45.351
Not sure which one? Click
Which role do they need?

00:00:45.401 --> 00:00:46.605
for a short guide.

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:52.570
Next, click Create invitation,
and copy the link now.

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:54.019
It's shown only once.

00:00:55.551 --> 00:01:00.251
Send it to your colleague. They sign in
with this same e-mail address to join,

00:01:00.301 --> 00:01:02.229
and the link works for 7 days.

00:01:03.202 --> 00:01:07.002
Open invitations shows
everyone who hasn't joined yet.

00:01:07.052 --> 00:01:08.883
Click Withdraw to cancel one.

00:01:10.223 --> 00:01:13.143
Later, change someone's
role right in the list.

00:01:13.193 --> 00:01:16.678
Remove takes away their access,
and you can invite them again.

00:01:18.223 --> 00:01:21.673
Everyone you invite sees all
of your company's websites.

00:01:21.723 --> 00:01:24.160
What they can change
depends on their role.

00:01:25.269 --> 00:01:29.169
So, open Team, invite people,
choose a role, share the link,

00:01:29.219 --> 00:01:31.175
and change roles whenever you need.

00:01:32.223 --> 00:01:36.987
Your team is in. Next, learn how
credits work in tutorial 10.2.
